# the sched_ext scheduler (sched/README.md): the loader holds the link; when the kernel ends
# the scheduler (an error, sysrq-S) the loader exits and vh-init starts it again with a
# backoff; between the two the kernel's own scheduler runs. Enabled by
# doas vh-ctl enable vh-sched after the kernel of the machine has sched_ext.
exec = /usr/local/sbin/vh-sched run
restart = always
restart_delay = 2s
restart_max = 60s
caps = bpf sys_admin perfmon sys_nice
log = file
